posts.body:
Hmmm, if you put the shapes and colors as notetags on the equipment and name your picture files like ShapeColor, isn't it something like this then (replace X and Y with the number of your equipment type, starts from 0):
let shape = $gameActors.actor(1).equips()[X].meta.Shape;
let color = $gameActors.actor(1).equips()[Y].meta.Color;
$gameScreen.picture(1).show(shape+color, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0);
EDIT:
Or maybe the other show picture script (never know what's the difference, but I tested and this one seems to work):
$gameScreen.showPicture(1, shape+color, 1, 500, 300, 100, 100, 255, 0);
